      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPS in the 900–1000 °C range activates short-circuit diffusion along the high-density grain boundaries of the milled powder.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::hypothesis_evidence_v2::d2ca66d33f4255df"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Activated diffusion brings oxygen and reactive Ti and Al into configurations that nucleate stable oxide precipitates.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5978046::hypothesis_evidence_v2::f7a616e2d022619d",
        "PMC6926650::hypothesis_evidence_v2::e3fc5e976e655c2d"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPS between 900 °C and 1000 °C produces a continuous nanocrystalline TiO2/Al2O3 network along BCC grain boundaries and within the matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5978046::hypothesis_evidence_v2::f7a616e2d022619d",
        "PMC6926650::hypothesis_evidence_v2::e3fc5e976e655c2d"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide precipitates pin grain boundaries, prevent coarsening, and thereby maintain high hardness.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5978046::hypothesis_evidence_v2::f7a616e2d022619d",
        "PMC6926650::hypothesis_evidence_v2::e3fc5e976e655c2d",
        "PMC12298864::hypothesis_evidence_v2::e097165f347ded04"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The TiO2/Al2O3 precipitate network blocks magnesium diffusion and suppresses magnesium volatilization.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The precipitate network creates a tortuous oxygen-diffusion path and supports formation of a protective surface oxide scale.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::hypothesis_evidence_v2::d2ca66d33f4255df"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide network enhances bulk densification.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPS at approximately 950 °C will produce a bulk alloy exceeding 98% theoretical density.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPS at approximately 950 °C will produce a Vickers hardness above 500 HV.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12298864::hypothesis_evidence_v2::e097165f347ded04",
